[6/7] escape bind (SUPER + CTRL + ESCAPE returns input from any capture)
  will do:
  --- ~/.config/hypr/ferry.lua (delete)
  - -- Written by `ferry setup`; `ferry setup --undo` removes this file and its require line.
  - 
